{"thought": "Remy has not replied, so the next step is for Bob to review the drafted proposal. I'll read back his two hard lines and describe the card as drafted.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "I've set two hard lines from your Telegram note: no Mondays, and nothing before 10:00am. I took your ask as a 45-minute call on a Meet link, sometime in the next two weeks starting Tuesday, Nov 10.

The card as drafted goes to Remy Calloway, with you in cc. It offers three times from your calendar: Tue, Nov 10, 3:15pm to 4:00pm; Wed, Nov 11, 11:45am to 12:30pm; and Fri, Nov 13, 3:45pm to 4:30pm. It asks Remy which one works.

Remy hasn't replied yet. Approve sends that note. Nothing goes out until you tap it."}}
